<section class="container page-section">
  <h1 class="section-title">About This Project</h1>
  <p>
    The Online Survey System is a web application for creating surveys, sharing them, and studying the
    answers that come back. It was built as a college project to practise the MVC pattern on a
    Node.js stack.
  </p>

  <h4 class="mt-4">How It Works</h4>
  <ol class="about-list">
    <li>Register an account and log in.</li>
    <li>Create a survey and give it a title and description.</li>
    <li>Add the questions you want to ask.</li>
    <li>Publish the survey and share the public link.</li>
    <li>Read the collected responses on the results page.</li>
  </ol>

  <h4 class="mt-4">Built With</h4>
  <ul class="about-list">
    <li>Node.js and Express for the server</li>
    <li>EJS templates for server-rendered pages</li>
    <li>MongoDB with Mongoose for storage</li>
    <li>Joi for server-side validation</li>
    <li>Bootstrap and Font Awesome for the interface</li>
  </ul>
</section>
